<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>An e-Way Bill is a unique identification number that serves as proof of the movement of goods, ensuring smooth movement and proper documentation.</span></li></ul>

	<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Lorry Receipt/Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">IBA-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty) are formal documents issued by registered packers and movers to ensure the safe transportation of goods. These documents provide a detailed account of the consignment, including the sender's and receiver's information, goods to be moved, and the pickup and delivery locations.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The IBA (Indian Brass Association) ensures that packers and movers adhere to specific guidelines, including the provision of LR/Bilty for all interstate services. This ensures transparency, accountability, and safety during the transportation process.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>Apart from the statutory paperwork, a reputable packer and mover in Chatra to Deoghar will provide comprehensive IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance coverage.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> This insurance policy covers the goods against any accidental collision, theft, or damage during transit. It ensures that in case of any unfortunate event, you are financially protected and can claim compensation for the damaged goods or lost items.</li>
		<li>The IRDAI policy provides coverage up to ₹100,000 for each consignment. However, if you require higher coverage, you can discuss and negotiate with the packer and mover for additional insurance options.</li>
		<li>By opting for this comprehensive insurance coverage, you can have peace of mind knowing that your belongings are well-protected throughout the transportation process.</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>Packers and Movers Chatra To Deoghar: Comprehensive Services</h3>
	<p>When considering a packer and mover for your household shifting from Chatra to Deoghar, ensure that they provide the following comprehensive services:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Transportation of household goods:</strong> A reliable packer and mover will handle the transportation of your belongings using a fleet of well-maintained vehicles, ensuring secure transportation.</li>
		<li><strong>Secure and insured warehousing services:</strong> In case your final destination is not available immediately, reliable packers and movers provide warehousing services for temporary storage of your goods.</li>
		<li><strong>Expert packing and unpacking services:</strong> Professional packers utilize high-quality packing materials and experienced packing teams to safely pack your belongings and provide efficient unpacking services at your destination.</li>
	</ul></div>
